<Slide style={{ padding: '32px 60px', background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
  <Box style={{
    flexDirection: 'column',
    width: '100%',
    height: '100%',
    gap: 20,
  }}>
    {/* 页眉 */}
    <Box style={{
      flexDirection: 'row',
      alignItems: 'center',
      justifyContent: 'space-between',
      height: 40,
      borderBottom: '2px solid #1E4FA8',
    }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>研究背景与动机</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>Background & Motivation</Text>
    </Box>
    {/* 内容 */}
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, height: 580 }}>
      {/* 左侧文字 */}
      <Box style={{
        flexDirection: 'column',
        gap: 16,
        width: 520,
        paddingTop: 8,
      }}>
        <Box style={{
          background: '#F0F5FC',
          borderRadius: 8,
          padding: 18,
          gap: 10,
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>现实痛点</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
            现代检测器在分布内表现优异，但跨数据集（不同环境、不同标签体系）时性能急剧下降。Waymo 事故说明真实场景包含罕见遮挡、轨迹与评估集未覆盖的工况。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
          background: '#FFFFFF',
          border: '1px solid #D6DCE5',
          borderRadius: 8,
          padding: 18,
          gap: 10,
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>两个纠缠的退化因素</Text>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
              <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>① 视觉分布偏移</span>：图像统计不同导致检测器"看不懂"
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
              <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>② 标签分类法偏移</span>：数据集命名/拆分/合并不同，检测器输出语义合理但在严格目标词汇表下被判错
            </Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
          background: '#1E4FA8',
          borderRadius: 8,
          padding: 16,
          marginTop: 4,
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 500 }}>
            核心问题：跨数据集掉点，有多少是"看不懂图"，有多少是"叫不对名字"？
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      {/* 右侧图片 */}
      <Box style={{
        flex: 1,
        flexDirection: 'column',
        gap: 10,
        alignItems: 'center',
      }}>
        <Image
          src="C:/Users/LYX10/Downloads/Typora/牛只数据集/cdod_icpr_ppt/assets/fig1_cross_dataset_comparison.png"
          style={{
            width: 500,
            height: 375,
            objectFit: 'contain',
            border: '1px solid #D6DCE5',
            borderRadius: 8,
          }}
        />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', textAlign: 'center' }}>
          Fig.1 同一张 COCO 图像在四个不同源模型下的检测对比
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
